  "verseCount": 36,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nyima kua malu â Bena Moaba ne Bena Amona ne Bena Meunima bakuabo bakalua kuluangana ne Yehoshafata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe bantu bakuabo bakalua, bakambila Yehoshafata ne, Tshisumbu tshia bantu tshinene tshidi tshilua kûdi tshifuma ku Sulia dishiya dia dishiha dia Luehu; monai, tshitshidi ku Hazazona-tamâ (udi Ene-gedi mene). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafata wakatshina, wakahangidisha bua kukeba Yehowa; wakela mukenji wa bantu bajile bia kudia mu nseke yonso ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Yuda bakadisangisha bua kukeba Yehowa; bakatula kukeba Yehowa, bafume ku misoko yonso ya Bena Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafata wakimanaku mpala kua tshisumbu tshia Bena Yuda ne Bena Yelushalema, mu nsubu wa Yehowa, mu tshiendedi tshihia-tshihia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakamba ne, Yehowa, Nzambi wa hatatu betu, wewe kuena Nzambi wa mu diulu, anyi? Wewe kuena mukokeshi wa makelenge onso a ha buloba, anyi? Bukokeshi ne bukole bidi mu tshianza tshiebe, nunku kakuena muntu udi mua kukukolela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe Nzambi wetu, kuakihata bena buloba aba ku mpala kua bantu bebe Bena Isalele, kuakabuha bana ba Abalahama, mulunda webe, tshiendelele, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobo bakashikamamu, bakuashila dina diebe tshitendelelu tshia tshijila, bamba ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bialua malu makole kutudi, nansha muele wa nvita, nansha kulumbulula, nansha tshihuhu, nansha tshiole, tuetu netuimane ku mpala kua nsubu eu ne ku mpala kuebe, bualu bua dina diebe didi mu nsubu eu, netudile kudi mu makenga etu, ne wewe neutunvuile, neusungile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katataka, mona, Bena Amona ne Bena Moaba ne ba ku mikuna ya Seî bawakakandika Bena Isalele bualu buabo ne, Kanuluanganyi nʼabo, hakadibo bafuma mu Ejipitu nunku bakasesuka kudibo, kabakabashiha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi mona, mudibo batufuta, bakuluila bua kutuihata mu buhianyi buebe buwakutuha bua tuetu kubuhiana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wetu, kuena ubalumbuluishe, anyi? Bualu bua tuetu katuena ne bukole bua kuluangana ne tshisumbu etshi tshinene tshilualua kutuluisha, katuena bamanye mua kuenza; kadi mesu etu adi kûdi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Yuda bonso bakadi bimane ku mpala kua Yehowa ne bana babo bakese ne bakashi babo ne bana babo balume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Nyuma wa Yehowa wakatulukila Yahaziele, muana wa Zekâya, muana wa Benaya, muana wa Yiele, muana wa Matanaya, Muena Lewi wa bana ba Asafa, munkatshi mua tshisumbu tshia bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba ne, Unvuai, Bena Yuda bonso ne bonso ba mu Yelushalema, ne wewe mukelenge Yehoshafata, Yehowa udi wamba ne, Kanutshinyi, kanukemi hua tshisumbu etshi tshinene; bualu bua nvita ei kanyenu, nya Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makelela nuye kudibo; monai, bobo badi baluila ku mukuna wa Sisi; nenusangakene nʼabo kunfudilu kua tshibanda, ku mpala kua tshihela tshia Yeluele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuena ne bua kuluangana nvita ei; nudijadike, nuimane talalâ, numone luhandu lua Yehowa ludi nʼenu, nuenu Bena Yuda ne Bena Yelushalema; kanutshinyi, kanukemi; nuye kudibo hatshiabu; bualu bua Yehowa udi nʼenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafata wakinama mutu wandi hanshi ha buloba; Bena Yuda bonso ne bonso ba mu Yelushalema bakatua mpala yabo hanshi, bakatendelela Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Lewi ne bana ba Kohata ne bana ba Kola bakajuka, bakatumbisha Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele ne dî dikole.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabika hatshiatshia, bakaya ku tshihela tshia Tekoa; hakadibo baye, Yehoshafata wakimana, wakamba ne, Unvuai, Bena Yuda ne ba mu Yelushalema! Nueyemene Yehowa Nzambi wenu, bua nuenu nujadikibue; nuitabushe baprofete bandi, bua nuenu nuikale ne diakalengele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakahungeye dî ne bantu, yeye wakasungula bantu bua kuimbilabo Yehowa misambu ne bua kumutumbishabo mu buakane buandi hakadibo baye ku mpala kua bena nvita, bamba ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakahita Bena Yuda ku tshibumba tshia mu tshihela, bakatangila kuakadi tshisumbu tshia bantu, monai, anu bitalu bilale hanshi ha buloba, nansha muntu wakahanduka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakalua Yehoshafata ne bantu bandi bua kuhaulabo bintu, bakasangana bubanji ne bilulu bia bungi, ne bintu bia mushinga mukole biakanyengabo; kabakamanya mua kubituala; bakashalaku matuku asatu bua kuhaulabo bintu, bualu bua biakadi bia bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dituku dinai bakadisangisha mu tshibanda tshia Belaka; bualu bua bakatumbishaku Yehowa; nunku bakidika muaba au ne, Tshibanda tshia Belaka tô ne ku dituku edi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Bena Yuda ne ha mu Yelushalema bakahingana ku Yelushalema ne disanka, ne Yehoshafata wakadi wenda ku mpala kuabo; bualu bua Yehowa wakabayuisha disanka ku mpala kua bakadi nʼabo lukuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakalua ku Yelushalema mu nsubu wa Yehowa ne bisanji ne nzenze ne mpungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ditshina dia Nzambi diakakuata ba mu bisamba bionso hakunvuabo ne, Yehowa wakaluangana nvita ne bena lukuna ba Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bukelenge bua Yehoshafata buakadi ne ditalala; bualu bua Nzambi wakamuha ditalala mu nseke yonso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafata wakakokesha mu Yuda; wakadi ne bidimu makumi asatu ne bitanu hakabangeye kukokesha; wakakokesha bidimu makumi abidi ne bitanu mu Yelushalema; bina dia mamu wandi diakadi Azuba, muana mukashi wa Shilihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakenda mu nshila ya Asa tatuʼandi, kakasesukamu, wakenza malu akadi mimpe ku mesu kua Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi yeye kakumusha bitendelelu biakadi ku mutu kua mikuna; bantu bonso kabakafila mitshima yabo kudi Nzambi wa batatuʼabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
